Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.42,0:00:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYS ON LAPTOPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, just a few more feet and....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.72,0:00:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 再过来几米
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we are, gentlemen, the Gates of Elzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.72,0:00:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们到了 男士们 艾奇巴伯之门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Good Lord. RAJESH: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:18.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:22.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't panic. This is what the last 97 hours have been about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:22.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别慌张 我们花了九十七小时就是为了这一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stay frosty. There's a horde of goblins...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.19,0:00:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保持冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:27.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on the other side of that gate guarding the Sword of Azeroth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:27.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}门另一边有群武装妖精保卫着艾泽拉斯之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Warriors, unsheathe your weapons. Magic wielders, raise your wands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:29.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}勇士们 拿出武器
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:32.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lock and load.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:32.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-魔法巫师 举起你们的魔杖 -准备妥当
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:34.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, blow the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.62,0:00:34.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 炸开门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Blowing the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正要炸门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Control-shift-B.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.87,0:00:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}Control加Shift加B
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RUMBLING AND GOBLINS SCREAMING ON LAPTOPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, my God, so many goblins. HOWARD: Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 太多妖精了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:48.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't just stand there. Slash and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:48.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别光站在那里 边砍边移动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:49.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stay in formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:49.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}保持队形
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:53.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, you got one on your tail. -That's all right, my tail's prehensile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:53.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 你的尾巴上有个妖精 -没关系 我的尾巴能甩动 我把它们甩飞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got him, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我控制住它了 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tonight, I spice my meat with goblin blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我的肉要用妖精的血来做酱汁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, it's a trap. They're flanking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 那是陷阱 它们要从侧面包围我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, he's got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:02.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它抓到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, he's got Raj. Use your sleep spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 它抓到拉吉了 快用你的睡眠魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:06.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon. Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.19,0:01:06.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've got the Sword of Azeroth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拿到艾泽拉斯之剑了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Forget the sword, Sheldon, help Raj. -There is no more Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-别管剑了 谢尔顿 帮帮拉吉 -谢尔顿已经不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am the sword master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.36,0:01:16.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是剑王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:19.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard, look out. -Damn it, man, we're dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:19.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 小心 -该死 我们快没命了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye, peasants.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 乡巴佬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHOOSHING ON LAPTOPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:23.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个混蛋用传送术跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The bastard teleported.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:28.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's selling the Sword of Azeroth on eBay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.08,0:01:28.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在拍卖网站上出售艾泽拉斯之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:31.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You betrayed us for money? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.84,0:01:31.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为了钱背叛我们？你是什么样的人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a rogue knight elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是卑鄙的骑士精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:35.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you people read character descriptions?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:35.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们没有看角色描述吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait, wait. Somebody just clicked "Buy It Now."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:38.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 有人出价要买
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am the sword master.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.31,0:01:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是剑王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:07.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Whoo! I'm all sweaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:07.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我满身大汗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wanna log on to Second Life and go swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:10.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要登录《第二人生》去游泳吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:12.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just built a virtual pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:12.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚做了虚拟泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I can't look at you or your avatar right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 现在我无法看你或是你的虚拟角色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:18.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:22.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sounds like your neighbor's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:22.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来你的邻居回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:25.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't forget the mail you took so you'd have an excuse to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.31,0:02:28.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了你故意拿走的邮件 那样子你才有借口跟她说话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.86,0:02:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:35.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stealing snail mail, very old school. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:35.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}偷邮件 非常老套 我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:39.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, the mailman did it again. He-- Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:39.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 邮差又弄错了 他…对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, no, hi, Leonard. This is Doug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:41.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 莱纳德 他是道格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Doug, this is my neighbor, Leonard. -What's up, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.66,0:02:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-道格 他是我的邻居 -你好吗 老兄？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:48.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bro. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:53.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, no. I just-- I got your mail again, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 你的信又送到我家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, thank you. I've got to talk to that mailman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.97,0:02:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 我得跟邮差谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, that's probably not such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.68,0:03:01.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 或许那不是个好点子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Civil servants have a documented propensity to, you know, snap, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据纪录 公务员的脾气都不太好 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:09.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:09.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No problem. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.82,0:03:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别客气 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, and bye, bro. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny for your thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用一分钱赌你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:29.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's the matter? -No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.96,0:03:29.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么了？ -我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's fine, the guy she's kissing is really fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮没事 跟她亲吻的那个男人也没事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:36.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Kissing? What kind of kissing? Cheeks, lips, chase, French?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:36.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲吻？什么样的吻？脸颊、嘴唇、嬉闹或舌吻？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:40.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是浪漫派的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't tell me that your hopeless infatuation...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别跟我说你的无望迷恋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is devolving into pointless jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在变成没有意义的嫉妒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm not jealous. I'm just a little concerned for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.85,0:03:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我不是嫉妒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:54.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Didn't like the look of the guy she was with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:54.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是有点担心她 我不喜欢她身边那个男人的长相
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because he looks better than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:56.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他比你帅？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:01.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He was kind of dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:01.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他看起来很梦幻
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At least now you can retrieve the black box...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少你现在能拿回黑匣子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...from the smoldering wreckage that was once your fantasy of dating her...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:07.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从曾幻想跟她约会的破碎梦里清醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and analyze the data so that you don't crash into geek mountain again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}分析一下资料 你才不会再做呆事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:17.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I disagree. Love is not a sprint. It's a marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不同意 爱情不是短跑冲刺 而是马拉松长跑
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:22.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A relentless pursuit that only ends when she falls into your arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:22.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不停地追逐 让她投入你的怀抱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:25.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or hits you with the pepper spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:25.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是用防狼喷雾攻击你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I'm done with Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我跟佩妮玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna be more realistic and go after someone my own speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:30.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要认清楚事实找一个跟我一样的伴侣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Like who? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.73,0:04:32.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-譬如说谁呢？ -我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Olivia Geiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:34.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}奥莉薇雅盖格？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:38.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The dietitian at the cafeteria with the limp and the lazy eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:38.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}餐厅里那个跛脚弱视的营养师？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:42.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah. -Well, I don't think you have a shot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:42.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -我不认为你有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have noticed that Leslie Winkle recently started shaving her legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最近我注意到莱丝丽温克开始刮腿毛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, given that winter is coming, one can assume she's signaling...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}考量到冬天快来了 我想她是在示意大家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...sexual availability.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.17,0:04:51.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她希望有性活动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. You guys work in the same lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 你们在同一间实验室工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So? -There are pitfalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-所以呢？ -那有难处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When it comes to sexual-harassment law...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}提到性骚扰防治法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:05.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I'm a bit of a self-taught expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:05.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可说是自学高手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:09.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, if I were to ask Leslie Winkle out, it would just be for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:09.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 如果我要约莱丝丽温克出去 我们只是要去吃晚餐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:13.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not gonna walk into the lab, ask her to strip naked and dance for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:13.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不是要走进实验室 请她脱光衣服为我跳舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, then you're probably okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你应该没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hello, Leslie. -Hi, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哈喽 莱丝丽 -嗨 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'd like to propose an experiment-- -Goggles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.99,0:05:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想做个实验… -护目镜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I would like to propose an experiment. -Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我想做个实验 -等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm trying to see how long it takes a 500-kilowatt oxygen-iodine laser...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想知道用五百千瓦的氧碘雷射
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to heat up my cup of noodles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加热杯面得花多少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I've done it. About two seconds, 2.6 for minestrone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我实验过了 大约两秒 意大利蔬菜浓汤是两点六秒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.47,0:05:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MACHINE WHIRRING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, I was thinking more of a biosocial exploration...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之我要做个生物社会探险
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a neurochemical overlay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}神经化学类的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, are you asking me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.14,0:05:56.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 你在约我出去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:59.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was going to characterize it as the modification...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.36,0:05:59.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为那是在调整
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:04.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of our colleague/friendship paradigm with the addition of a date-like component.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.98,0:06:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的同事友谊关系和约会伙伴的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we don't need to quibble over terminology.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们不需要担心这些虚词
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What sort of experiment would you propose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.28,0:06:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你提议做什么实验？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is a generally accepted pattern in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:13.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在这个领域有些大家都能接受的模式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:16.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I pick you up, take you to a restaurant, then we would see a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:16.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会接你去餐厅 然后我们去看电影
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Probably a romantic comedy featuring the talents...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许看部浪漫喜剧片 主演的演员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of Hugh Grant or Sandra Bullock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.96,0:06:21.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是休格兰特或桑德拉布洛克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And would you agree the primary way we would evaluate...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.88,0:06:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你应该同意我们评估
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:29.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the success or failure of the date would be based on the biochemical reaction...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.64,0:06:29.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}约会成功与否的方法全看晚安吻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-...during the good-night kiss? -Heart rate, pheromones, et cetera, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:33.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-带来的生化反应吧？ -心跳、费洛蒙之类的 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:35.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't we stipulate the date goes well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:35.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不假设约会进行顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and move to the key variable?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.90,0:06:37.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直接跳到关键点呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You mean kiss you now? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要我现在吻你？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Define the parameters of the kiss. -Closed mouth, but romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-解释一下亲吻的限制 -闭上嘴巴但很浪漫的那种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:45.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Mint? -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:45.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-要口香糖吗？ -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.03,0:06:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MINTS CRACKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Shall I count down from three? -No, I think it needs to be spontaneous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.87,0:06:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-要从三开始倒数吗？ -不 我想要自然一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you think? -You proposed the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得呢？ -你提议要做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:07.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think you should present your findings first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想该由你先阐述你的发现
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:09.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:09.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很公平
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:12.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On the plus side, it was a good kiss, reasonable technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.55,0:07:14.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}优点是这个吻不错 技巧合理 没有多余的口水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...no extraneous spittle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On the other hand, no arousal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是却没什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:21.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-None? -None.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:21.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一点都没有？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:22.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你抽时间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Thank you. -Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:28.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}None at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.41,0:07:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完全没感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:44.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, if you were a robot and I knew and you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:44.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 如果你是机器人 我知道 但你不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would you want me to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:48.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会要我告诉你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那得视情况而定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:56.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I learn that I'm a robot, will I be able to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.93,0:07:56.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道自己是机器人时我能够接受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:02.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe, although the history of science fiction is not on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:02.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许可以 虽然说科幻小说的历史并不支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Uh, let me ask you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:06.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I learn that I'm a robot...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:06.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我知道我是机器人后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:11.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would I be bound by Asimov's Three Laws of Robotics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:11.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得服从阿西莫夫的三大机器人定律吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:15.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might be bound by them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:15.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你现在或许就在服从它们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:23.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have you ever harmed a human being? -Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:23.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你伤害过人类吗？ -当然没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:27.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever harmed yourself, except in cases where a human being...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:27.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有伤害过自己除非有人类的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...would have been endangered?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}遭到了威胁？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, no. -I smell robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.97,0:08:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -我想你是机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, what's going on? -Internet's been down for half an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-发生了什么事？ -网络断线半小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:43.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also, Sheldon may be a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:43.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿可能是机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how did it go with Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.98,0:08:47.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟莱丝丽还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we tried kissing, but the Earth didn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们试着接吻 但没有感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:56.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, any more than the 383 miles that it was gonna move anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:56.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是说一点感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I've seen that look before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看过那个表情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:04.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is just gonna be two weeks of moping and tedious emo songs...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.79,0:09:04.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这将会是听两星期沉闷乏味的情歌
