Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:27.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 那首歌真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:31.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you're compiling a mix CD for a double suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:31.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你是要刻盘 在结伴自杀时听的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:35.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I hope that scratching post is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:35.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望那个猫抓柱是你要用的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:38.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know what you're thinking. I've taken your asthma into account.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.30,0:10:38.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你在想什么 我考虑到你有哮喘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's a feline geneticist in San Diego...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在圣地牙哥有个猫科遗传学家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who's developed the cutest little hypoallergenic calicos.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}研发出最可爱的抗敏花斑猫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Listen-- -I've been thinking about names.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:45.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-听着… -我已经想好了名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:50.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm kind of torn between Einstein, Newton and Sergeant Fuzzy Boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.90,0:10:50.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道该挑爱因斯坦、牛顿或毛靴士官
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think you can satisfy your need for a relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得养基因工程猫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:56.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a genetically altered cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能满足你对爱情的需求吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:11:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe, if it's a cute little cuddly cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:11:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许可以 如果它是只可爱的猫咪的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, come on, Leonard....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}少来了 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:06.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is obviously about Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:06.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}元凶是佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:10.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:13.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The woman's not interested in me. The woman rejected me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:13.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个女人对我没兴趣 她拒绝过我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, look. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:15.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have as much of a chance of having a sexual relationship with Penny...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我认为你跟佩妮发展出性关系的机率
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as the Hubble telescope does...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:23.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像哈勃望远镜能发现黑洞中心一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of discovering at the center of every black hole...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:27.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is a little man with a flashlight searching for a circuit breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:27.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}像有人拿着手电筒在找断路器一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:34.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nevertheless, I do feel obligated to point out to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:34.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我觉得我必须告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:36.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that she did not reject you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.69,0:11:36.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她没有拒绝你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did not ask her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.20,0:11:39.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有约过她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:41.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't ask her. I should ask her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有约过她 我该那么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. Now, that was not my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那不是我的重点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My point was, don't buy a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的重点是不要买猫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.96,0:11:52.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 但你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should march over there and ask her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:54.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该过去约她
