Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, hey, Leonard. -Good afternoon, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 莱纳德 -午安 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, hi, hey. Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was wondering if you had plans for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想问你有没有任何晚餐计划
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, you mean, dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是说今天的晚餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:18.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There is an inherent ambiguity in the word "dinner."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:18.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚餐的定义一向不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Technically, it refers to the largest meal of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:21.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}技术上来说它是一天中最丰富的一餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So to clarify here, by dinner, I mean supper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我对晚餐的定义是晚上要吃的饭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:26.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Supper? -Or dinner, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.37,0:12:26.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-晚上要吃的饭？ -或是晚餐 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was thinking 6:30 if you can go, or a different time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:30.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想约你六点半 换个时间也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, 6:30 is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.25,0:12:31.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}六点半我没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Great. -Yeah, I like hanging out with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太棒了 -对 我喜欢跟你们出去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Us guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.34,0:12:38.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know, Sheldon, Howard, Raj. Who all is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.59,0:12:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的 谢尔顿、霍华德跟拉吉 他们都会来吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:44.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.47,0:12:44.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...might all be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.72,0:12:47.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可能都会来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or a subset of them might be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是他们之中几人会来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Algebraically speaking, there are too many unknowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 事实上未知的情况太多
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For example, Sheldon had Quizno's for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}譬如谢尔顿午餐吃意大利三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sometimes he finds that filling, other times he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.65,0:12:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时候他觉得很饱 有时候不会饱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:01.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's no fault of Quizno's. They have a varied menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:01.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是意大利三明治店的错 他们的菜单很丰富
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, whatever, it sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 随便 那听起来很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did we say a time? -Six-thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.16,0:13:08.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们有说定时间吗？ -六点半
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没问题吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's fine. -It's not carved in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没问题 -不一定要约得那么死
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. Six-thirty is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.83,0:13:13.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 六点半很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:15.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll get my chisel. Heh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:15.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会带着我的凿子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:24.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To carve the-- Okay, I'll see you at 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:24.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好雕…好吧 六点半见
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do I look?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.81,0:13:36.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看起来怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.07,0:13:43.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能说得更明确一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:47.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell I'm perspiring a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:47.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能看出我流了点汗吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:52.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. The dark crescent-shaped patterns under your arms conceal it nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:52.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你腋下的半月形印子把汗水隐藏得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What time is your date? -Six-thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你几点约会？ -六点半
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perfect, that gives you two hours and 15 minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.54,0:13:59.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 你还有两小时十五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:02.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for that dense molecular cloud of Aramis to dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:14:02.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让浓浓的古龙水变淡一点
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is it too much? -Not if you're a rugby team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-太浓了吗？ -除非你是橄榄球队员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:11.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, you didn't join us because you stuffed yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.26,0:14:11.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 你不跟我们去是因为你吃饱了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:13.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a chicken-carbonara sub at Quizno's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:13.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你吃了鸡肉培根鸡蛋三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would I join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么我会跟你们去？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:17.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:22.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you know what? Maybe this isn't such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:22.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？或许这不是个好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, well, now, there's always the possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 凡事都有可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:27.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that alcohol and poor judgment on her part...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.24,0:14:27.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许酒精跟她的判断力出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...might lead to a nice romantic evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你们有个浪漫夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're right. Alcohol, poor judgment. It could go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说的对 酒精跟判断力出问题 或许我们会很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:38.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, there's the other possibility that this day kicks off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.42,0:14:38.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然今天也可能会出差错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an unpleasant six months of you passing awkwardly in the hall...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让你们六个月不敢走过走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...until one of you breaks down and moves to another zip code.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直到你们之中有人崩溃 决定要搬家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could have stopped at, "It could go well."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以不必多说这一段
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I could have, I would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果可以 我也想那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:54.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I'm a perfectly nice guy. There's no reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:54.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是个大好人 我们不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:56.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we couldn't go to the restaurant and have a lovely dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:56.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到了餐厅后没办法好好吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe take a walk afterwards, talk about things we have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之后去散步 聊聊我们的共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"You love pottery? I love pottery."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:04.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你喜欢陶器吗？我喜欢陶器
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:07.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, there's a pause. We both know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:07.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来我们停下来 心知肚明会发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We kiss. It's a little tentative at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:09.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会接吻 刚开始有些不自在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But I realize, she's kissing me back, she's biting my lower lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我发现她在回吻我 她咬着我的下唇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She wants me. This thing is going the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:15.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她要我 事情自然地发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're gonna have sex. Oh, God. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会上床 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is the sex starting now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你开始发春了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm having a panic attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.46,0:15:25.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是恐慌症发作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:28.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay. Well, then, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.01,0:15:28.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I could, I wouldn't be having an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以冷静的话 就不会恐慌症发作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:33.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-That's why they call it a panic attack. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.56,0:15:33.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是它被称之为恐慌症的原因 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you just sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能坐下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, sit down. Now close your eyes. -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 坐下 闭上眼睛 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:38.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just do it. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:38.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-照我的话去做 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:42.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, try to increase your alpha-wave activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:42.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试着增加你的阿尔法波活动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:45.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -It's a biofeedback technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:45.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -生理回馈疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:47.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's relaxation through brainwave manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:47.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}透过控制脑波放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I read it in the Journal of American Neuroscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:49.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在《美国神经科学期刊》看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was sparsely sourced, but I think the science is valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它的资料来源有点不足 但我想它的科学论点应该站得住脚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I probably have it here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我把期刊放在附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who am I kidding? I can't go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在跟谁开玩笑？我无法撑过这次约会
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You need to call her and cancel. -Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:59.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你得打电话跟她取消 -我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -What should I tell her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:01.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 -我该怎么告诉她？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't know. Tell her I'm sick. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不知道 说我生病了 -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:06.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not the kind that would make her wanna take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:06.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是那种会让她想照顾我的病
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:10.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But nothing so critical that she'll feel uncomfortable if I wanna try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.51,0:16:10.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不是她会觉得不舒服的大病 以免我还想再试着跟她出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got it. So I'm assuming nothing venereal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}懂了 我想我不该说你得了性病
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll just tell her that you had a routine colonoscopy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:20.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟她说你去做例行的结肠镜检查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and haven't quite bounced back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是尚未恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:25.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Give me the phone. -I thought you wanted to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-电话给我 -我以为你要取消约会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't. If I don't show up, she'll still be expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行 如果我不出现 她也会等你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why would she be expecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么她会等我？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stop asking me all these questions. I need to take another shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别问我这些问题 我得再冲一次澡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are the rest of the guys meeting us here? -Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-其他人会到这里跟我们碰面吗？ -哦 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turns out that Raj and Howard had to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德跟拉吉得工作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Sheldon had a colonoscopy, and he hasn't quite bounced back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿做了结肠镜检查 尚未恢复正常
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ooh, my uncle just had a colonoscopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我叔叔刚做完结肠镜检查
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:59.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding. Well, then, that's something we have in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:59.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在开玩笑吧 那是我们的共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:01.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么说？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:08.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We both have people in our lives who wanna nip intestinal polyps in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.35,0:17:08.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们身边都有人想趁早除掉肠道息肉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what's new in the world of physics?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.74,0:17:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}物理学界有什么新消息？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:26.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, with the exception of string theory, not much has happened since the 1930s...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.08,0:17:26.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除了弦理论 19世纪30年代后就没什么发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:28.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and you can't prove string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:28.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们无法证实弦理论
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At best you can say, "Hey, look, my idea has an internal logical consistency."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.63,0:17:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}顶多只能说“看吧 我的理论内部逻辑是一贯的”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:39.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ah. Well, I'm sure things will pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:39.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信情况会好转的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's new at the Cheesecake Factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}芝乐坊有什么消息？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, uh, not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, we do have a chocolate key lime that's moving pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们推出的巧克力柠檬口味卖得还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.32,0:17:54.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, what about your, uh, hallway friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的走廊朋友呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:07.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Doug? Oh, yeah. I don't know. I mean, you know, he's nice and funny, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.04,0:18:07.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}道格吗？我不知道 他是个好人又风趣 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Can I get you started with some drinks? -No. Bzzz.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以点饮料了吗？ -还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:13.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You were saying, "But...."? -I'd like a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.13,0:18:13.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你说到“但是…” -我想喝点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just say the "but" thing about Doug, and then I'll get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.47,0:18:16.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟我说道格的事 我会叫她回来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, it-- I don't know. It's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我不知道…是我的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm still getting over this break-up with Kurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还在因为跟库尔特分手的事伤心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this thing with Doug would just be rebound sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟道格的关系就是报复性性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:30.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ugh. Don't get me started on rebound sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别跟我提报复性性爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just-- It's my pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那正是我的模式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I break up, then I find some cute guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我分手后会再找个帅哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:38.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and then it's just 36 meaningless hours of....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:38.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后就是没有意义的三十六小时的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:39.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:43.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure that I do. Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:43.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不太确定我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:49.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that one 36-hour experience or is that 36 hours spread out over...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.54,0:18:49.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那只是连续三十六小时的经历 还是一个美丽夏季中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:53.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...say, one glorious summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:53.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}断断续续组成的三十六小时呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It's usually over a weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.17,0:18:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 通常只会维持一个周末
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And trust me, you do not feel good after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相信我 之后你会觉得不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, chafing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:19:00.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}皮肤磨擦发炎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.35,0:19:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}情感上不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:05.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, yeah. Emotional chafing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:05.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然了 情感磨擦发炎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:14.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, do you wanna see something cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:14.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要看一件很酷的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:20.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can make this olive go into this glass without touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:20.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以不碰这颗橄榄就让它跑进这个杯子里去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:23.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How? -Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:23.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么会呢？ -物理学
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, centrifugal force.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哇 离心力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:34.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, it's centripetal force, which is an inward force...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.92,0:19:34.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上是向心力 杯子内部的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...generated by the glass acting on the olive. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对橄榄起了作用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:39.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.55,0:19:39.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, if you were biting on the olive...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在吃橄榄的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:47.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'd be in a non-inertial reference frame and would--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.27,0:19:47.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是在非惯性比对框架里…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Are you okay? -Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你没事吧？ -我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you spill ketchup?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打翻了蕃茄酱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.78,0:19:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -我有事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't wanna go to the emergency room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你确定不用去急诊室？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:01.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用了 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:03.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It stopped bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.78,0:20:03.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}血止住了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, you did throw up. Isn't that a sign of a concussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:06.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你吐了 那不是脑震荡的迹象吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but I get carsick too, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:09.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我也会晕车 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry about your car, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了 关于你的车我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, no, it's fine. You got most of it out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 没关系 你都吐在车外了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:19.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The poor guy on the bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:19.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个骑自行车的人好可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:22.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had a nice time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:22.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.35,0:20:25.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:27.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, um, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:27.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:32.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard. -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 -怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Was this supposed to be a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:35.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是约会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:37.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这次吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:40.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.11,0:20:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This was just you and me hanging out with guys who didn't show up...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是你跟我一起吃饭 而其他人没办法出席
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because of work and a colonoscopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.95,0:20:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他们得工作 还有人做了结肠镜检查
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.37,0:20:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I was just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.37,0:20:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我只是问一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:57.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I take a girl on a date-- And I do, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:57.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我跟女生约会时…我约会的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--she knows she's been dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她会知道她在约会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Capital D. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bold face, underlined, like, dated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.97,0:21:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}非常明确地会知道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I might have a concussion. I'm gonna go lay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:13.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我或许真有脑震荡 我得去躺一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So how was your date? -Awesome. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:21.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-约会还顺利吧？ -非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Score one for liquor and poor judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.08,0:21:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒精跟判断力出问题得一分
